Frozen GTFS teaching slice. NOT production. Do not edit these files.

Structure : GTFS text files, comma separated despite the .txt extension
Origin    : synthetic, generated by tools/build_slice.py, in the shape of the
            real Swiss feed (opentransportdata.swiss). Small on purpose.
Service   : Mon 2026-09-14 and Tue 2026-09-15, declared in calendar.txt
Regenerate: uv run python tools/build_slice.py

Three properties of this slice matter and are deliberate. They are the same
three properties the real feed has. See CLAUDE.md.

1. stop_times has one row per stop, not per trip.
2. The operating date lives in calendar.txt. Nothing else carries a date.
3. Departure times pass 24:00:00 for journeys continuing after midnight.

A re-published feed arrives later via: git merge origin/feat/day-three
It extends the calendar to Wed 2026-09-16 and adds one IR 75 trip.
It is absent from main until that command runs.
